-- HELD: not part of the migration. Run once, only with the owner's explicit OK.
--
-- Applies delete_account_data to accounts tombstoned before it existed, merged wallet
-- shells included. This REWRITES auth.users VALUES (email, metadata, phone, password)
-- and removes auth.identities and sessions for every tombstoned account, and it can't
-- be undone. The same identity can open a new account afterwards.
--
-- Safe to re-run: the RPC is idempotent and leaves wallets a live account holds now.
-- The account-retention cron removes these accounts' avatar files once this has run.

SELECT public.delete_account_data(id)
FROM public.profiles
WHERE deleted_at IS NOT NULL;
